{"availability":"available","full":"lione12138/summer-school-radar","name":"summer-school-radar","description":"Summa: a discipline-agnostic directory of funded and affordable summer schools, winter schools, and research training with verified deadlines, fees, and official sources.","category":"Education","language":"HTML","stars":7,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-12T10:36:30Z","updated":"2026-10-11T13:01:43Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://lione12138.github.io/summer-school-radar/","topics":["academic-training","education","github-pages","open-data","phd","python","research-training","scholarships","static-site","summer-school","winter-school"],"demo":"https://lione12138.github.io/summer-school-radar/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:24.252Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:24.252Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:24.252Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T02:05:24.252Z","stars":7,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An open-source, discipline-agnostic scanner for high-quality research training opportunities — summer schools, winter schools, training schools, field schools, and short courses. Subject area is never an eligibility gate.","It is a fixed trusted-source scanner with rule-based extraction and transparent per-field evidence — not a fully automatic all-web radar. It scans a curated registry of trusted academic sources and extracts deadline / funding / fee / duration evidence together with the supporting text. Unresolved records remain available for maintainer audit; the public site is fail-closed on deadline, duration, mode, title, and link safety. Financial accessibility controls recommendation status, while a narrowly defined ordinary directory can list a current official programme without making a funding claim.","Public APIs: editions/opportunities · programme catalogue"],"features":["trusted source registry instead of random web crawling","one config/sources.yaml registry for both page sources and structured direct collectors","structured extraction for deadline, funding, duration, mode, eligibility, and location","automatic, explicitly labelled multi-session schedules, so an outer programme window is never presented as one continuous course","hard filters with visible failed conditions"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lione12138/summer-school-radar/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1cbbcb767bbf9924fe6be4ad5363665e048b208db87074ebf0fe7b3bfbd85423","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:24.407Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:24.407Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An open-source, discipline-agnostic scanner for high-quality research training opportunities — summer schools, winter schools, training schools, field schools, and short courses. Subject area is never an eligibility gate.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lione12138/summer-school-radar/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Remote API keys must be supplied by the user.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lione12138/summer-school-radar/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"1cbbcb767bbf9924fe6be4ad5363665e048b208db87074ebf0fe7b3bfbd85423","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lione12138/summer-school-radar/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:24.408Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T13:01:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lione12138/summer-school-radar/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:24.409Z","hash":"1cbbcb767bbf9924fe6be4ad5363665e048b208db87074ebf0fe7b3bfbd85423","originalBytes":27910,"storedBytes":27910,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","github","run","scan","runs","site","source","key","mode","api","audit","candidates.json","current","daily","deepseek","discovery","docs","evidence","latest","official","only","records","scheduled","schools","search","see","serper","snapshot